Package: unconfoundedr
Title: Test Unconfoundedness by Comparing RCT and Observational Effects
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(person(given = "Diogo", family = "Ribeiro", role = c("aut","cre"),
                    email = "diogo.debastos.ribeiro@gmail.com",
                    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0000-0000-0000")))
Description: Comprehensive toolkit for testing unmeasured confounding by
    comparing marginal treatment effects between RCT-like and observational
    datasets. Features multiple estimators (IPW, AIPW, TMLE, G-computation, 
    matching), effect measures (risk difference, risk ratio, odds ratio), 
    transportability weighting with auto-detection via covariate shift tests,
    bootstrap and analytical inference, extensive diagnostics including
    overlap assessment and balance checks, sensitivity analysis with E-values,
    and comprehensive visualization and reporting capabilities.
